Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.82,0:00:39.49,IN - JP,,0,0,0,,If I had wings I could fly, oh oh
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.49,0:00:41.49,IN - JP,,0,0,0,,If I don't have them, I just walk
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.49,0:00:42.86,IN - JP,,0,0,0,,In the dry wind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.86,0:00:44.28,IN - JP,,0,0,0,,That's my way
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.28,0:00:45.62,IN - JP,,0,0,0,,Even if it's strange
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.62,0:00:47.93,IN - JP,,0,0,0,,I felt a mission that I had to carry out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.93,0:00:50.21,IN - JP,,0,0,0,,What about you? I followed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.21,0:00:52.57,IN - JP,,0,0,0,,Listened to my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.57,0:01:00.01,IN - JP,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to shed tears for the surrounding evil, oh
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.01,0:01:06.72,IN - JP,,0,0,0,,Wondering what's right or wrong is already a bad move
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.72,0:01:10.39,IN - JP,,0,0,0,,Tossed by the raging waves and fierce winds
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.39,0:01:12.31,IN - JP,,0,0,0,,We never never ever...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.31,0:01:14.40,IN - JP,,0,0,0,,We won't fall down
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.82,0:01:28.79,IN - JP,,0,0,0,,Raging flame won't let me escape
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.79,0:01:30.58,IN - JP,,0,0,0,,Now the battle begins
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.58,0:01:32.79,IN - JP,,0,0,0,,There is no going back
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.79,0:01:35.32,IN - JP,,0,0,0,,Even when struck by fear
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.32,0:01:36.71,IN - JP,,0,0,0,,Don't turn your back
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.71,0:01:38.09,IN - JP,,0,0,0,,Battle begins
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.09,0:01:40.26,IN - JP,,0,0,0,,There is no going back
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.42,0:01:44.22,IN - JP,,0,0,0,,Face it with a strong heart and soul
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.22,0:01:46.14,IN - JP,,0,0,0,,Feel the burning fighting spirit
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.14,0:01:47.97,IN - JP,,0,0,0,,Believe in the burning fighting spirit
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.97,0:01:49.68,IN - JP,,0,0,0,,Keep on keep on
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.68,0:01:52.68,IN - JP,,0,0,0,,It is still too early to end
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.03,0:02:04.82,IN - JP,,0,0,0,,オラたちなら どこへだって行ける
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.82,0:02:08.62,IN - JP,,0,0,0,,そう ここは僕たちの世界だ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.62,0:02:12.25,IN - JP,,0,0,0,,怖くても、 泣いちやっても
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.25,0:02:14.21,IN - JP,,0,0,0,,大丈夫、 笑って!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.21,0:02:16.71,IN - JP,,0,0,0,,ひとりじゃないから！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.96,0:02:21.75,IN - JP,,0,0,0,,手にえれる 輝く笑顔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.75,0:02:25.59,IN - JP,,0,0,0,,それが本当の宝物
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.38,0:02:27.84,IN - JP,,0,0,0,,Burning, Burning
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.34,0:02:29.35,IN - JP,,0,0,0,,Fighting, fighting
